{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:27 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:27 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:27 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>練馬師告東尼和華將鍾易禮，於今晚快活谷第五場憑「佐治傳奇」雙雙贏馬開齋，並且捧走香港中華總商會盃，而「佐治傳奇」亦取得在港首場勝利。</p><p>馬主鄭加文說：「『佐治傳奇』之前兩個賽事都排外檔，今次排內檔理想，所以比之前更有信心，不過同場有不少對手，Tony告東尼則有信心。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e51b02bf243d28b9d268d7f549eab63/2026-10/0cdc5b58-fa1c-4e33-af7d-024672e4940e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe11533651158475ff13103f35bb93dc/2026-10/6ba0caf4-1d1b-46e5-8bd6-48ca45a924ca.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cbe9396b3d8443ef64b1d44b9f1c040/2026-10/6c3ed9ab-9c98-471e-96dd-66807c6522b3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a05faf9411dfd94c5ebd007dc4cac2f6/2026-10/6de07b00-43f8-4502-a1dd-585d4a51b414.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4b44d7efb7297a9e4152b78908ed371/2026-10/9fd5f00f-b2f0-465a-9e37-a04289d70a54.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fd56534880ec3f391b95a4157ad79db/2026-10/20f1b32f-82d2-4906-8ab7-539efe9934ca.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/222b3e943d0c23a3d5c2c64381dbafdc/2026-10/76b8700d-aeef-4a46-a6cf-02e836c1b433.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51ebab21698b3d4205dfcf0790e018d3/2026-10/80e4172f-ccb1-4fdc-80e9-c6047b7907d3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a66cde55fe3f42aa22a4baedea213be2/2026-10/197ea8f0-fa66-4298-a390-a556fb17f89f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fac97d3b87ae19fdc4088bb5385f21d/2026-10/288b4d3e-2f9c-4277-a9ea-82ec643cd5f4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1aaa12ff445800bc4e64e6606263f78d/2026-10/527ab1b8-afdc-4e51-bffb-078b7d67d83c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c56f9c39539688b6894596c6047eda44/2026-10/550da1dd-76c3-4fd7-a6ad-78b7ecd93671.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://ima